{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a triangle in a hand-drawn world. Roll around and encounter other triangles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden platforms are your best friend. They will always get you to where you want to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, sometimes they need to be persuaded by a nearby button or lever...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must you be confined to remaining a triangle? Certainly not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the power to change your shape simply by picking up additional line segments or dropping ones you currently have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing your segment count will be useful as you travel across the land...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will you roll?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes of many sizes and colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Textures from scanned sheets of paper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic music system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story to be told</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Howdy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015870/b187625ca7d858a81661b43550cc94fc8333702d.jpg"},{"name":"The Adventure Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015870/a03c8a2245522a79721efb2263db1053f41f3906.jpg"},{"name":"Across the Country","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015870/80ea0c5c6cdd182a2dcc0497dd311d33f2ea3065.jpg"},{"name":"Rollin' Into Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/i